{"4700460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arthur’s Tale", "steam_appid": 4700460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4773120], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Arthur’s Tale – Where Gravity is Your Worst Enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur is old, he’s tired, and his knees definitely hurt, but he’s not letting a few &quot;minor&quot; obstacles like giant killer robots or bottomless pits stop him. In this stylized 3D platformer, your mission is simple: <strong>Don't. Die.</strong> (Spoiler: You will.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s waiting for you inside this colorful deathtrap?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision (or Luck) Platforming:</strong> Master every jump with surgical precision, or watch Arthur tumble into the abyss in glorious 60 FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses with Bad Attitudes:</strong> From forest-dwelling titans to grumpy mechanical sentinels, these guys aren't interested in a friendly chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run for Your Life:</strong> Experience high-speed chases where stopping to smell the roses results in immediate flattening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully Brutal:</strong> Don’t let the pretty colors fool you. It’s basically a Saturday morning cartoon that’s trying to kill you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The &quot;Try Again&quot; Counter is Waiting...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve made sure the &quot;Restart&quot; button is nice and big, because you’ll be seeing it often. Grab your pickaxe, take a deep breath, and show this world that Arthur still has some fight left in him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now—or Arthur will never hear the end of it!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Arthur’s Tale – Where Gravity is Your Worst Enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur is old, he’s tired, and his knees definitely hurt, but he’s not letting a few &quot;minor&quot; obstacles like giant killer robots or bottomless pits stop him. In this stylized 3D platformer, your mission is simple: <strong>Don't. Die.</strong> (Spoiler: You will.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s waiting for you inside this colorful deathtrap?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision (or Luck) Platforming:</strong> Master every jump with surgical precision, or watch Arthur tumble into the abyss in glorious 60 FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses with Bad Attitudes:</strong> From forest-dwelling titans to grumpy mechanical sentinels, these guys aren't interested in a friendly chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run for Your Life:</strong> Experience high-speed chases where stopping to smell the roses results in immediate flattening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully Brutal:</strong> Don’t let the pretty colors fool you. It’s basically a Saturday morning cartoon that’s trying to kill you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The &quot;Try Again&quot; Counter is Waiting...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve made sure the &quot;Restart&quot; button is nice and big, because you’ll be seeing it often. Grab your pickaxe, take a deep breath, and show this world that Arthur still has some fight left in him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now—or Arthur will never hear the end of it!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Guide Arthur through a world that’s out to get him! Sprint, leap, and faceplant your way through a vibrant adventure overflowing with devious traps, oversized bosses, and enough &quot;Try Again&quot; screens to last a lifetime. It’s colorful, it’s chaotic, and yes—you’re probably going to fail. A lot.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700460/cd3c94ed1dbac9ca5018f178209c55b6cc8deb26/header.jpg?t=1781469418", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700460/81ee31720cbc5069f23e397528fc39721493045e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781469418", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700460/81ee31720cbc5069f23e397528fc39721493045e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781469418", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 570</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super / AMD RX 5600 XT</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Cleaver Studio"], "publishers": ["Cleaver Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 4773120, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"